    "body": "Reworked the Weapons detail view. Settings now start in collapsed functional groups, field search opens matching groups, and the right pane grows with the page instead of using a hidden nested scrollbar. The left weapon list keeps its visible scrollbar. Meaningful field help is now available across the parsed record; unresolved schema fields stay in an Unidentified section with no filler tooltip. Please open Weapons, select a field-heavy gun such as the Cattleman Revolver, expand several groups, and confirm that the organization and page scrolling feel right.",
